# {{lb|en|baseball|slang}} A [[split-finger fastball]].
#: ''He’s got a nasty '''split'''.''
# {{lb|en|bowling}} A result of a first throw that leaves two or more pins standing with one or more pins between them knocked down.
# A [[split shot]] or [[split stroke]].
