# A bottle of wine containing 37.5 centiliters, half the volume of a standard 75-centiliter bottle; a [[demi]].
# {{lb|en|athletics}} The [[elapsed]] [[time]] at [[specific]] [[intermediate]] points in a [[race]].
#: ''In the 3000 m race, his 800 m '''split''' was 1:45.32''
# {{lb|en|video games}} The elapsed time at specific intermediate points in a [[speedrun]].
# {{lb|en|construction}} A tear resulting from [[tensile]] [[stress]]es.
# {{lb|en|gambling}} A [[division]] of a [[stake]] happening when two [[card]]s of the kind on which the stake is laid are [[deal]]t in the same [[turn]].
# {{lb|en|music}} A recording containing songs by multiple artists; a [[split single]].

